      "statement": "Header/body hardening: X-Forwarded-Host/Proto are ignored unless --trust-forwarded-headers/CELLD_TRUST_FORWARDED_HEADERS=1 is set (last value wins); a request-target scheme/authority is ignored; Host controls request.url with malformed values rejected; the default 1 GiB body limit applies to the public listener and /do/<ID> with 413 refusal.",
